NOTE ON SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the reconstruction code, analysis scripts, and derived
datasets authored for this study. It does NOT cover:

  * ns-3 itself, which is distributed under the GNU GPLv2 and must be obtained
    separately from https://www.nsnam.org/. This repository provides a contrib
    module intended to be placed inside an existing ns-3 tree; it is not a
    redistribution of ns-3.

  * The source publication being reproduced (Fitos et al., Internet of Things
    29:101472, 2025), its figures, or its text. The digitized PRR/SNR curve in
    data/fig2-digitized/ is a measurement extracted from a published figure for
    the purpose of scientific reproduction and analysis; it is not the authors'
    original measurement data, and any reuse should cite the original paper.

  * Nordic Semiconductor datasheet values referenced in
    contrib/leo-wsn/model/nrf52840-current-table.h, which are quoted for
    interoperability and documentation purposes with attribution to the
    nRF52840 Product Specification v1.11.
